Tesla withdrew its termination notice on a graphite supply deal with Australia's Syrah.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:20.780
The company reversed an earlier threat to end the agreement. The move eased concerns over raw material

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:27.420
sourcing for battery production and lifted Syrah's share price. Both parties are now continuing the

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:35.000
existing supply relationship. Tesla driver charged after head-on crash destroys 1968 Ford Mustang.

