00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:20.800
Now, one thing worth watching is the trust problem inside Tesla's own self-driving AI team.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:26.320
Current and former members of the team have voiced doubts about depending on the system in life

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:32.460
critical situations. The internal gap between engineering confidence and public statements remains

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:38.840
