00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:45.620
operation. This internal skepticism comes at a time when supervised FSD continues to expand in

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:51.640
approved markets. Taking a step back from today's headlines, the addition of encrypted dashcam

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:57.360
storage and granular parental controls in the same software update reveals how Tesla treats the car

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:03.440
