00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:09.240
credentials to access footage while the new settings let owners disable browser, theater, and arcade

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:15.820
access without third-party tools. These features address two distinct owner concerns, data privacy

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:21.580
